我以为自己有进步了  结果并没有
I thought I was getting better at it, but clearly I'm not.

260
00:12:30,630 --> 00:12:32,170
你改善很多了
Yes, you are.

261
00:12:32,710 --> 00:12:36,010
好几次我不开心时  你都看出来了
There have definitely been days when I was sad and you could tell.

262
